      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0048",
        "text": "･"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0050",
        "text": "−"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0052",
        "text": "两面以外的"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0054",
        "text": "〜"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0056",
        "text": "牌几乎都能通过。由此可见，宝牌越接近中间，提供的信息就越有力。"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0057",
        "text": "而且，根据以下理由，可以推读出：那张牌与听牌有关、原本是两面子完全形的情况较多。"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0058",
        "text": "*宝牌通常是最适合作为孤立牌保留的牌，因此很难认为原本是两面子余牌形。*（例外是染手等特殊手牌，或重视安全度时保留安全牌的情况。）"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0059",
        "text": "出于同样的理由，*原本是靠张形的可能性也会降低。*"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0060",
        "text": " 如果宝牌接近两端，为了重视靠张张数而切掉宝牌的情况也不少；但如果宝牌是３〜７的中张牌，这种可能性就尤其低。"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0061",
        "text": "*原本是无雀头形的情况也会略微减少。*（持有"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0063",
        "text": "这样的牌形时，"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0065",
        "text": "切掉后就会成为无雀头形，但如果宝牌是"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0067",
        "text": "，就会将"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0069",
        "text": "拆掉，选择保留宝牌雀头的两面子余牌形等，这是出于打点方面的理由。）"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0070",
        "text": "不过，还不到能排除的程度。"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0071",
        "text": "进一步说，如果还结合了上次提到的"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0073",
        "text": "→"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0075",
        "text": "（宝牌为"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0077",
        "text": "）这样的情况，上述例外也几乎都不再存在，因此原本是两面子完全形的可能性就接近100%。能想到的例外，大概只有无雀头形中持有"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0079",
        "text": "的情况了。"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0081",
        "text": "面对上图这样的牌河，有人立直时，只要相关牌不是使其进张听牌的那一张，就基本可以读出其听牌是"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0083",
        "text": "−"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0085",
        "text": "，或者"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0087",
        "text": "与某张牌的双碰。也就是说，"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0089",
        "text": "放铳的概率约为50%（"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0091",
        "text": "也有25%以上的概率放铳）。即使已经听牌，除非是非常值得一搏的手牌，否则也不应该切。（即使是宝牌"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0093",
        "text": "→"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0095",
        "text": "这样的情况，"
      },
      {
        "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section009:b0097",
        "text": "附近的牌也会比F级牌更危险。）"
      }
    ],
